			"Message": "refactor(Air): rename identifiers to PascalCase per project conventions\n\nUpdate StartMonitoring.rs and WaitForShutdownSignal.rs to use PascalCase naming for all identifiers, aligning with CodeEditorLand's PascalCase convention defined in CLAUDE.md.\n\nChanges include:\n- Add `#![allow(non_snake_case, non_camel_case_types, non_upper_case_globals)]` attribute\n- Rename struct fields (connection_monitor → ConnectionMonitor, health_monitor → HealthMonitor)\n- Rename function parameters (app_state → AppState, health_manager → HealthManager)\n- Rename local variables (tick → Tick, error → Error, etc.)\n- Rename test functions (test_start_monitoring → TestStartMonitoring)\n- Normalize doc comment formatting (//! → ///)\n\nAlso apply minor README formatting: wrap problem statement and value proposition in blockquote style, and fix link wrapping.\n\nFollows the naming convention applied across Land/Element/Mountain and other components.",
			"SHA": "db50b722265dff4282d310f82ad515e8028d456c"
		},
